WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:16.349
was smiling as everyone put on their aprons.

2
00:00:16.369 --> 00:00:20.333
"Something exciting happened yesterday!"

3
00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.115
"What?" Nina asked.

4
00:00:23.135 --> 00:00:29.832
"Mom said I was being super responsible taking care of Gurpy.

5
00:00:29.852 --> 00:00:31.453
So she let me get a hamster.

6
00:00:32.453 --> 00:00:33.733
I named her Nibbles."

7
00:00:33.753 --> 00:00:36.714
"Wow, that's cool!"

8
00:00:37.054 --> 00:00:37.874
Jason said.

9
00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:40.575
Chef pointed to the recipe.

10
00:00:40.595 --> 00:00:43.336
"Today we're making vegetable pancakes."

11
00:00:44.696 --> 00:00:45.716
Bobby made a face.

12
00:00:45.736 --> 00:00:48.877
"Vegetables? In pancakes?"

13
00:00:50.578 --> 00:00:51.738
"Oh, yachaejeon!"

14
00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:52.798
Nina said.

15
00:00:52.818 --> 00:00:55.239
"They're Korean pancakes."

16
00:00:56.699 --> 00:00:58.260
"That's right," Chef said.

17
00:00:59.156 --> 00:01:00.317
"Let's prep the vegetables.

18
00:01:01.177 --> 00:01:02.477
We need two and a half cups."

19
00:01:02.497 --> 00:01:07.159
"That's a lot of vegetables," Bobby said.

20
00:01:07.179 --> 00:01:10.041
"Vegetables are good for you!"

21
00:01:10.481 --> 00:01:11.141
Izzie said.

22
00:01:11.161 --> 00:01:14.322
"Eating healthy food is responsible."

23
00:01:16.883 --> 00:01:18.304
Nina read the ingredients.

24
00:01:18.324 --> 00:01:21.765
"Onion, carrot, zucchini."

25
00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.146
Then she paused.

26
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:25.427
"Um, Chef?

27
00:01:25.867 --> 00:01:27.488
Can we use green onions?

28
00:01:28.476 --> 00:01:31.117
My aunt uses them when she makes yachaejeon."

29
00:01:31.137 --> 00:01:33.818
"Sure," Chef said.

30
00:01:33.838 --> 00:01:36.440
"We can use any kind of vegetables."

31
00:01:39.161 --> 00:01:41.502
The kids started cutting vegetables into strips.

32
00:01:42.642 --> 00:01:43.623
Izzie cut a carrot.

33
00:01:44.583 --> 00:01:45.784
Bobby sliced an onion.

34
00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:48.425
Jason worked on a zucchini.

35
00:01:49.985 --> 00:01:51.366
Izzie pointed to the recipe.

36
00:01:51.386 --> 00:01:55.948
"You're supposed to cut it into thin strips, Jason."

37
00:01:57.504 --> 00:01:58.464
Jason shrugged.

38
00:01:58.484 --> 00:02:00.265
"They all taste the same."

39
00:02:00.285 --> 00:02:06.386
"Be responsible and follow the directions," Izzie said.

40
00:02:06.406 --> 00:02:09.607
"My carrot slices look perfect."

41
00:02:11.648 --> 00:02:15.389
"Sorry!" Jason said in a teasing voice.

42
00:02:15.409 --> 00:02:18.430
"I'm not as perfect as you are."

43
00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.230
Bobby giggled.

44
00:02:21.871 --> 00:02:22.911
Izzie frowned at him.

45
00:02:22.931 --> 00:02:26.932
"You boys are immature," Izzie said.

46
00:02:28.028 --> 00:02:30.090
"Super immature!"

47
00:02:31.971 --> 00:02:33.853
Nina finished slicing green onions.

48
00:02:35.554 --> 00:02:38.356
Once all the vegetables were ready, they put them in a bowl.

49
00:02:38.376 --> 00:02:43.440
"Next we add flour, salt, and water," Jason said.

50
00:02:44.881 --> 00:02:47.843
Nina stirred the mixture until the vegetables were all coated.

51
00:02:47.863 --> 00:02:49.625
"It's ready."

52
00:02:51.366 --> 00:02:53.608
Chef added cooking oil to a frying pan.

53
00:02:58.952 --> 00:03:02.413
When it was hot, he added the vegetable mixture to the pan.

54
00:03:02.433 --> 00:03:04.834
"I'll make one big pancake for now.

55
00:03:05.655 --> 00:03:06.355
We can share it."

56
00:03:07.876 --> 00:03:09.836
"Are vegetable pancakes good?"

57
00:03:10.157 --> 00:03:10.917
Bobby asked.

58
00:03:11.997 --> 00:03:12.798
Nina nodded.

59
00:03:12.818 --> 00:03:14.999
"They're really yummy."

60
00:03:16.639 --> 00:03:17.500
Bobby grinned.

61
00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.280
"I'll try it.

62
00:03:20.101 --> 00:03:23.542
Trying new things is super responsible—like Izzie!"

63
00:03:23.562 --> 00:03:27.564
"Why don't you guys make the dipping sauce?"

64
00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:28.244
Chef said.

65
00:03:29.768 --> 00:03:33.070
Izzie put soy sauce, vinegar, and red pepper flakes in a bowl.

66
00:03:35.371 --> 00:03:37.252
Bobby shook in some sesame seeds.

67
00:03:37.272 --> 00:03:41.014
"Bobby!" Izzie said.

68
00:03:41.034 --> 00:03:44.236
"You didn't measure them carefully!"

69
00:03:44.256 --> 00:03:47.197
"It's fine," Bobby said.

70
00:03:48.978 --> 00:03:50.979
Chef slid the pancake out of the pan.

71
00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:53.661
He put it on a plate and cut it up.

72
00:03:58.583 --> 00:03:59.284
Izzie gulped.

73
00:04:00.512 --> 00:04:03.213
The pancake didn't look like the pancakes she ate at home.

74
00:04:04.013 --> 00:04:05.193
What if she didn't like it?

75
00:04:05.894 --> 00:04:07.194
Would her friends tease her?

76
00:04:07.214 --> 00:04:11.555
"Hmm, crunchy and delicious!"

77
00:04:12.475 --> 00:04:13.216
Bobby said.

78
00:04:13.236 --> 00:04:15.636
"I'm going to make these at home!"

79
00:04:15.956 --> 00:04:16.817
Jason said.

80
00:04:18.637 --> 00:04:19.618
Izzie was quiet.

81
00:04:19.638 --> 00:04:22.578
"Try it," Nina whispered.

82
00:04:22.598 --> 00:04:25.499
"It's okay if you don't like it."

83
00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.100
Izzie took a small bite.

84
00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.480
Then a bigger one.

85
00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.521
"I love yachaejeon!"

86
00:04:34.481 --> 00:04:35.242
She smiled.

87
00:04:35.262 --> 00:04:38.363
"Almost as much as I love my pets!"

88
00:04:41.303 --> 00:04:44.084
Later Chef gave Izzie some chopped zucchini.

89
00:04:44.104 --> 00:04:47.045
"It's a good snack for your hamster."

90
00:04:47.065 --> 00:04:49.766
"Thanks!" Izzie said.

91
00:04:52.207 --> 00:04:55.188
As she walked outside with her friends, she cleared her throat.

92
00:04:57.268 --> 00:04:59.811
"I'm sorry if I was bossy today."

93
00:04:59.831 --> 00:05:03.234
"You were bossy!"

94
00:05:03.715 --> 00:05:04.496
Bobby said.

95
00:05:04.516 --> 00:05:07.559
"But it's okay," Nina said.

96
00:05:08.420 --> 00:05:09.321
Jason nodded.

97
00:05:09.341 --> 00:05:13.325
"And saying sorry is super responsible!"
